  "body": "## What changed\n\nUnsaved-changes tracking and a save prompt.\n\n- `History::mark_clean()` / `History::is_dirty()` (`crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`) record the history position at the last save or load. Undo back to that point is clean, and a redo past it is dirty again. A new command after undoing past the save point leaves the document dirty for good. New and Open start clean, and selection, camera, hover and layout never dirty the document.\n- The window title gets a leading `*` while dirty.\n- The window X now queues a Quit, the same as Ctrl+Q. Quit, New or Open over unsaved changes is held behind a Save / Don't Save / Cancel modal (`crates/ui/src/unsaved.rs`, `egui_app/unsaved_prompt.rs`). Escape or an outside click counts as Cancel. Save on an untitled document asks for a path first, and a failed or cancelled save keeps the app open with the reason on the status line. If the GPU failed at startup, the X still closes at once.\n- The shell runs on winit, not eframe, so it simply stops exiting on `CloseRequested`. The scripted file commands (`OpenProjectFile` / `SaveProjectFile`) skip the prompt, so headless runs never hang.\n- Changed tests: `file_ops_round_trip_through_commands` now expects the `*` in the title; two New-document tests now answer Don't Save.\n\n## Readings / pins\n\n- app `dirty_flag`: `dirty_tracks_the_saved_point_through_undo_and_redo`, `a_new_branch_makes_the_saved_point_unreachable`\n- ui `egui_app::tests::unsaved`: `close_over_unsaved_changes_prompts_and_does_not_exit`, `save_from_the_prompt_saves_then_quits_and_a_failed_save_stays_open`, `new_over_unsaved_changes_asks_and_a_clean_document_never_does`, `undo_back_to_the_saved_point_clears_the_mark`\n- green: app commands_undo 30; ui lib 240 (2 ignored), machine 6, shell 19, egui_app 3, feedback 6; clippy on app and ui is clean.\n- Not hand-tested in the real window: the X close path is covered by harness tests only.\n\nChangelog: Unsaved changes are tracked: the title shows a leading `*`, and closing the window, Ctrl+Q, New or Open over unsaved work asks Save / Don't Save / Cancel; a cancelled or failed save keeps the app open\n\nFixes #107\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
